  "text": "CAULFIELD RETURNED SAILORS, SOLDIERS AND AIRMEN'S CLUB\nCAULFIELD BRANCH R.S.S.&A.I.L.A.\nPRESIDENT:\nF. J. E. GYNGELL\nSECREIANT:\nJ. E. BROADBENT\nTELEPHONES: LF 1142, LF 1143\n4 ST. GEORGE'S ROAD\nELSTERNWICK, S.4\n10th June, 1955.\nC• McFadyen,\nEsq., C.B.E.\nSt Leonards Court,\nSOUTH YARRA.\nDear Charles,\nThe President and Committee of the Club\nwish to congratulate you on your appointment as a\nCommander of the Order of the British Empire.\nYour many friends here are delighted\nto see you receive this honor.\nYours sincerely,\n(J.E.\nBOADBENT)\n/ Shoarlan\nSecretary•\nJEB/RM\nv0lo",
